import{_ as i,o as n,c as t,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 225 | Origin Realm Deep Supplement: Cosmic-Level Being and Plane Transcendent Threshold","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 225 | Origin Realm Deep Supplement: Cosmic-Level Being and Plane Transcendent Threshold","no":225,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Origin Realm","Supplement","Cosmic-Level","Plane Transcendent"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","17-Plane Transcendent Standards","23-20% Activation Strategy"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0225_模块1-本源境补遗-宇宙级存在与位面至高门槛.md","filePath":"en/0225_模块1-本源境补遗-宇宙级存在与位面至高门槛.md"}'),o={name:"en/0225_模块1-本源境补遗-宇宙级存在与位面至高门槛.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,m,d){return n(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-225-origin-realm-deep-supplement-cosmic-level-being-and-plane-transcendent-threshold" tabindex="-1">Entry 225 | Origin Realm Deep Supplement: Cosmic-Level Being and Plane Transcendent Threshold <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-225-origin-realm-deep-supplement-cosmic-level-being-and-plane-transcendent-threshold" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 225 | Origin Realm Deep Supplement: Cosmic-Level Being and Plane Transcendent Threshold&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 17, 23</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-nine-realm-apex-—-from-intra-world-to-origin-layer" tabindex="-1">Introduction: The nine-realm apex — from intra-world to origin layer <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-nine-realm-apex-—-from-intra-world-to-origin-layer" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: The nine-realm apex — from intra-world to origin layer&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou (Wanling Hengmao Origin Cosmos)&#39;s Origin Realm is the nine-realm system&#39;s apex. World-Creation cultivators can create a small world; Origin Realm cultivators <strong>touch the cosmos&#39;s own origin</strong> — understanding the cosmos&#39;s ultimate operating rules, participating in cosmic law fine-tuning and optimization. Origin Realm strong ones are &quot;Plane Transcendents,&quot; the top power group in Heng Yuan Zhou.</p><p>The six top-level axioms manifest ultimate forms in Origin Realm: the anti-predation axiom requires Origin Realm strong ones&#39; power be used for guarding not predation; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires Origin Realm strong ones represent Myriad Races; the collective ascension axiom requires Origin Realm strong ones lead the cosmos&#39;s overall ascension; the causal self-discipline axiom requires Origin Realm strong ones&#39; law fine-tuning go through strict procedures; the law-first axiom ensures Origin Realm&#39;s definition is stable, not arbitrarily inflated; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This entry deep-dives Origin Realm&#39;s core: what is &quot;touching origin&quot;? What does the Plane Transcendent&#39;s four-dimensional assessment mean? Why is Origin Realm not the endpoint?</p><h2 id="i-what-is-touching-the-cosmic-origin" tabindex="-1">I. What Is &quot;Touching the Cosmic Origin&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-what-is-touching-the-cosmic-origin" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. What Is &quot;Touching the Cosmic Origin&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Origin is not a &quot;place,&quot; but the cosmic law network&#39;s <strong>bottommost operating mechanism</strong> — all laws ultimately trace back to origin; origin is &quot;the law above laws.&quot;</p><p>Touching origin means the cultivator&#39;s consciousness penetrates the law network layer, directly perceiving the cosmos&#39;s bottommost operating logic. This is not &quot;knowing more laws,&quot; but <strong>understanding why laws exist and why the cosmos runs this way</strong>.</p><p>After touching origin, the cultivator obtains permission to participate in cosmic law fine-tuning — not arbitrarily modifying laws, but under strict supervision, optimizing minor parameters in law operation, pushing the cosmos overall toward more stable, more efficient, more symbiotic evolution.</p><h2 id="ii-origin-realm-s-life-form" tabindex="-1">II. Origin Realm&#39;s Life Form <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-origin-realm-s-life-form" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Origin Realm&#39;s Life Form&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Origin Realm cultivators&#39; life form undergoes ultimate change:</p><ul><li><strong>Deep connection with origin</strong>: life imprint anchored in cosmic origin; physical destruction allows rebirth via origin anchoring</li><li><strong>Near-immortal</strong>: conventional attacks cannot pose lethal threat; only same-tier or higher-tier power can harm</li><li><strong>Multi-domain existence</strong>: simultaneously existing and operating on material plane, energy layer, consciousness domain, law network layer</li><li><strong>Cosmic-level perception</strong>: perception range covers the entire cosmos; can mobilize origin power on cosmic scale</li></ul><p>This life form change makes Origin Realm strong ones no longer &quot;an individual in the cosmos,&quot; but &quot;a functional node of the cosmos&quot; — their existence itself is part of the cosmos&#39;s operation.</p><h2 id="iii-plane-transcendent-s-four-dimensional-assessment" tabindex="-1">III. Plane Transcendent&#39;s Four-Dimensional Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-plane-transcendent-s-four-dimensional-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Plane Transcendent&#39;s Four-Dimensional Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Origin Realm strong ones&#39; formal certification — &quot;Plane Transcendent&quot; — uses the four-dimensional assessment system (Document 17):</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Weight</th><th>Core Requirement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Strength</td><td>40%</td><td>Reaching Origin Realm, independently mobilizing origin power</td></tr><tr><td>Mind</td><td>25%</td><td>Passing ethical review, upholding anti-predation and symbiotic ideals</td></tr><tr><td>Contribution</td><td>20%</td><td>Contribution value in civilization&#39;s top 20%, at least one civilization-level contribution</td></tr><tr><td>Responsibility</td><td>15%</td><td>Willing and able to bear plane-level+ public responsibility</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The four-dimensional assessment&#39;s core spirit is: <strong>strength is only the entry ticket; mind, contribution, and responsibility are the true certification</strong>. A cultivator with strong power but evil mind-state, even if reaching Origin Realm&#39;s power level, will not be certified as Plane Transcendent, but classified as a &quot;high-risk individual&quot; and supervised.</p><h2 id="iv-origin-realm-strong-ones-core-responsibilities" tabindex="-1">IV. Origin Realm Strong Ones&#39; Core Responsibilities <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-origin-realm-strong-ones-core-responsibilities" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Origin Realm Strong Ones&#39; Core Responsibilities&quot;">​</a></h2><p>As Plane Transcendents, Origin Realm cultivators bear the following core responsibilities:</p><ul><li><strong>Law fine-tuning participation</strong>: participating in cosmic law fine-tuning and optimization decisions</li><li><strong>Civilization direction leadership</strong>: as civilization&#39;s highest advisors, influencing cosmic evolution direction</li><li><strong>Talent cultivation</strong>: cultivating next-generation World-Creation and Origin Realm seeds</li><li><strong>Cosmic stability maintenance</strong>: monitoring law operation on cosmic scale, preventing law imbalance</li><li><strong>Cross-dimensional coordination</strong>: coordinating relations among different planes and civilizations</li></ul><p>Per the symbiotic civilization&#39;s &quot;strong-one duty system,&quot; Origin Realm strong ones invest at least 30% of time and energy annually on public responsibility.</p><h2 id="v-origin-realm-is-not-the-endpoint" tabindex="-1">V. Origin Realm Is Not the Endpoint <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-origin-realm-is-not-the-endpoint" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Origin Realm Is Not the Endpoint&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s extended setting (pending Terminology Committee calibration), above Origin Realm are two extended realms:</p><ul><li><strong>Multiverse Realm</strong>: multi-cosmos governance and law permission upgrade — when an Origin Realm strong one&#39;s influence expands from single cosmos to multi-cosmos, entering Multiverse Realm</li><li><strong>Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm</strong>: Myriad Races&#39; origin-balanced symbiotic ultimate form — when the cultivator&#39;s existence is fully in sync with Myriad Races&#39; origin balance, reaching ultimate form</li></ul><p>These two extended realms reserve infinite expansion space for the realm system, embodying the law-first axiom&#39;s &quot;never retconning, infinitely expandable&quot; promise. Origin Realm is not the ceiling, but a new starting point.</p><h2 id="vi-20-activation-strategy-and-origin-realm" tabindex="-1">VI. 20% Activation Strategy and Origin Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-20-activation-strategy-and-origin-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. 20% Activation Strategy and Origin Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The 20% Activation Strategy&#39;s (Document 23) core goal is, within the civilization&#39;s first epoch, activating individuals accounting for 20% of all beings to reach Origin Realm tier. This strategy&#39;s deep meaning is not &quot;cultivating 20 big shots,&quot; but:</p><ul><li>Building a large strong-one group, preventing individual strong ones&#39; power monopoly</li><li>Providing sufficient power foundation for the cosmos&#39;s overall ascension</li><li>Ensuring every Myriad Races group has its own Origin Realm representative</li><li>Forming a civilization atmosphere of &quot;strong ones emerge in succession,&quot; inspiring more life</li></ul><h2 id="vii-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">VII. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#vii-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VII. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: Origin Realm&#39;s law fine-tuning is the most efficient civilization contribution — one fine-tuning benefits the entire cosmos, far surpassing individual cultivation&#39;s energy waste</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: Origin Realm strong ones&#39; anti-predation stance is a hard condition of four-dimensional assessment; Predatory Faction cultivators even if power meets standards, fail the mind-state dimension are not certified</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo systems&#39; &quot;fierce realm&quot; ceiling and Origin Realm are separated by eight major realms&#39; qualitative leaps, fundamentally not on the same dimension</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Origin Realm sets no race limits; the 20% Activation Strategy ensures every Myriad Races group has an Origin Realm representative</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Origin Realm&#39;s law understanding is fully openly shared; Multiverse and Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm reserve interfaces for infinite expansion</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Origin Realm is the nine-realm system&#39;s apex, but not civilization&#39;s endpoint. In predatory-faction systems, &quot;Transcendent&quot; means &quot;no one can control me anymore&quot; — becoming the strongest is the endpoint; in the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, &quot;Transcendent&quot; means &quot;I must bear the greatest responsibility&quot; — Origin Realm strong ones are not the endpoint, but civilization&#39;s servants and leaders. From &quot;ruler&quot; to &quot;servant,&quot; this is Origin Realm&#39;s ultimate definition.</p><p>In the final analysis, Origin Realm supplement · cosmic-level being and Plane Transcendent threshold described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./17-位面至高强者标准.html">17-Plane Transcendent Standards</a> · <a href="./23-20％激活战略规划.html">23-20% Activation Strategy</a></li></ul>',36)])])}const h=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{u as __pageData,h as default};
